sequenceDiagram
  actor User as 用户
  participant Web as 研判页面
  participant API as API任务模块
  participant DB as PostgreSQL任务表
  participant Worker as Python Worker
  User->>Web: 提交伴随/碰撞/区域统计
  Web->>API: POST /analysis-tasks + contextId + 幂等键
  API->>DB: 同事务保存参数快照与 PENDING
  API-->>Web: 202 taskId
  Worker->>DB: 输入READY PENDING转QUEUED
  Worker->>DB: SKIP LOCKED 增加lease_generation与attempt_no
  Worker->>DB: 按租约版本续租 逐attempt写typed结果与证据
  Worker->>DB: 同事务校验租约 发布attempt与SUCCESS或记录FAILED/CANCELLED
  Web->>API: GET /tasks/taskId 轮询
  API->>DB: 当前状态与权限复核
  API-->>Web: 进度 结果引用 或错误码
